{"meta":{"id":"input-choice","category":"it/syntax/html/form","title":"체크박스 · 라디오 · 드롭다운 · HTML","subtitle":"(HTML)","summary":"같은 name 으로 묶기, value vs 보이는 값, select multiple, name 중복 → 배열 전달","tags":["html","f-form"],"color":"orange","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-orange","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-orange-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 border border-orange-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>HTML</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">체크박스 · 라디오 · 드롭다운 · HTML</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-orange-50/70 border border-orange-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 같은 name 으로 묶기, value vs 보이는 값, select multiple, name 중복 → 배열 전달</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">체크박스 · 라디오</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">html</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;!-- 체크박스: 여러 개 선택, 같은 name 사용 --&gt;\r\n&lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; name=&quot;hobby&quot; value=&quot;등산&quot; checked /&gt; 등산 &amp;nbsp;\r\n&lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; name=&quot;hobby&quot; value=&quot;낚시&quot; /&gt; 낚시 &amp;nbsp;\r\n\r\n&lt;!-- 라디오: 같은 name 중 하나만 선택 --&gt;\r\n&lt;input type=&quot;radio&quot; name=&quot;gender&quot; value=&quot;남자&quot; checked /&gt; 남자 &amp;nbsp;\r\n&lt;input type=&quot;radio&quot; name=&quot;gender&quot; value=&quot;여자&quot; /&gt; 여자</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">드롭다운 · 목록</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">html</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;select name=&quot;fruit&quot; id=&quot;fruit&quot; size=&quot;5&quot; multiple&gt;   &lt;!-- size: 보이는 줄 수, multiple: 여러 개 선택 --&gt;\r\n  &lt;option value=&quot;apple&quot;&gt;사과&lt;/option&gt;\r\n  &lt;option value=&quot;pear&quot; selected&gt;배&lt;/option&gt;\r\n&lt;/select&gt;</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">주의</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">value 는 서버로 전송되는 값, 태그 뒤 글자는 화면에 보이는 값</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong>name 이 중복되면 배열로 전달된다</strong> — 받는 쪽에서 배열로 받지 않으면 첫 값만 받는 등 오동작 (Java: getParameterValues)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">체크하지 않은 체크박스는 아예 전송되지 않는다 (null)</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> Java › 데이터 전달 (getParameterValues), jQuery › 값 읽기</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/html/form/input-choice","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"html","title":"HTML","path":"it/syntax/html"},{"id":"form","title":"폼 · 입력","path":"it/syntax/html/form"}],"hasImage":false}